body:
Due is a pleasure to use. It is so easy to use that I actually use it. (in contrast to the Clock app or Calendar event reminders that I only bothered to use for important reminders.

I have used this App for:
 Brewing tea, so it doesn&#39;t get bitter;
 Remembering to drink Tea/Coffee before it gets cold;
 Remembering to pack shoes for dancing;
 And many other mundane tasks that do not belong in a calendar
